"Grid-lookup benchmark (eu-oaz72.52). A 60x60 array of `r * 60 + c` is
read at every cell, ten sweeps, with `arr.get`: the hot path of an AoC
grid loop. Each sweep sums the grid, so the total is
10 * (3600 * 3599 / 2) = 64782000, computed independently."

` "the grid: cell (r, c) holds r * 60 + c"
grid: arr.from-flat([60, 60], range(0, 3600))

` "the sum of row `r` of `g`, read by coordinate"
row-sum(g, r): range(0, 60) map(cell(g, r)) sum

` "the cell at row `r`, column `c` of `g`"
cell(g, r, c): g arr.get([r, c])

` "the sum of every cell, read by coordinate"
sweep(g): range(0, 60) map(row-sum(g)) sum

` "one sweep of the grid; `_n` is ignored"
once(_n): grid sweep

` { target: :bench-array-grid-get
    verify: ["default-expectation"] }
bench-array-grid-get: {
  total: range(0, 10) map(once) sum
  RESULT: (total = 64782000) then(:PASS, :FAIL)
}
